2026-02-18 21:40:45.167 | 28052 | DEBUG    | Model request part: {"content": "Task Management:\nYou have access to the update_todo tool to help you manage and plan tasks. Use this tool VERY frequently\nfor complex tasks to ensure that you are tracking your tasks and giving the user visibility into your\nprogress. This tool is also EXTREMELY helpful for planning tasks, and for breaking down larger\ncomplex tasks into smaller steps. If you do not use this tool when planning, you may forget to do important\ntasks - and that is unacceptable. It is critical that you mark todos as completed as soon as you\nare done with a task. Do not batch up multiple tasks before marking them as completed.", "timestamp": "2026-02-18T21:40:45.165370+00:00", "dynamic_ref": "TodoListReminderCallback.todolist_system_prompt", "part_kind": "system-prompt"}
